### 香橙派镜像本地制品 ###
# 原始/候选/含密钥镜像、上游压缩包、环境配置与源码快照只允许放在
# hardware/image-artifacts/local/，不得进入 Git；Git 仅跟踪清单和脱敏证据。
/hardware/image-artifacts/local/**
!/hardware/image-artifacts/local/.gitkeep
/hardware/image-artifacts/**/*.img
/hardware/image-artifacts/**/*.img.xz
/hardware/image-artifacts/**/*.7z
/hardware/image-artifacts/**/*.bundle
/hardware/image-artifacts/**/*.env
!hardware/image-artifacts/evidence/**/*-public.pem

